WEBVTT

00:02:59.740 --> 00:03:03.436
sociologists, neurologists
and fertility specialists

00:03:03.460 --> 00:03:05.254
already know:

00:03:05.278 --> 00:03:08.444
that claiming your 20s
is one of the simplest,

00:03:08.468 --> 00:03:11.223
yet most transformative, things you can do

00:03:11.247 --> 00:03:13.918
for work, for love, for your happiness,

00:03:13.942 --> 00:03:15.707
maybe even for the world.

00:03:16.618 --> 00:03:18.453
This is not my opinion.

00:03:18.477 --> 00:03:20.047
These are the facts.

00:03:21.262 --> 00:03:24.416
We know that 80 percent
of life's most defining moments

00:03:24.440 --> 00:03:26.821
take place by age 35.

